elfth file contains combined data and results of analysis ( scales, indices etc. ). The files contain detailed data on expenditures, retrenchments, policy, organizational structure and tasks of the municipal police force, with an emphasis on policies and methods used to economize."}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"organizations"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"economics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"finance"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"internal politics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"police service"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"policy"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1982-11-30"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Studiecentrum voor hogere politieambtenaren * Warnsveld (research initiator)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Faculteit bestuurskunde, Universiteit Twente * Enschede (data collector)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-08-23"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-08-23"},{"typeName":"dateOfCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dateOfCollectionStart":{"typeName":"dateOfCollectionStart","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","va